ass document verification, hold professional credentials (TÜV / DEKRA or equivalent) and carry liability insurance. You see their rating and real customer reviews.\",\n          \"q\": \"Who are the inspectors?\"\n        },\n        \"title\": \"Car inspection (TÜV-style)\",\n        \"what_we_photograph\": {\n          \"a\": \"VIN, odometer, body from 8 angles, paint thickness per panel, tyres, wheels, brakes, suspension, engine bay, interior, OBD-II screen with codes. Every photo is timestamped and geo-tagged.\",\n          \"q\": \"What gets photographed?\"\n        },\n        \"whats_in_report\": {\n          \"a\": \"A 0–10 score, verdict (recommended / conditional / not recommended), list of critical and non-critical issues, repair cost estimate, photos of every problem, engine running video, and negotiation tips for the seller.\",\n          \"q\": \"What's in the report?\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"pricing\": {\n        \"extra_fees\": {\n          \"a\": \"The standard inspection includes the 60-point check. Add-ons (dyno diagnostics, endoscope, paint tester) are itemised in the quote. Nothing is charged without your consent.\",\n          \"q\": \"Are there extra charges?\"\n        },\n        \"how_price_formed\": {\n          \"a\": \"Selection — fixed monthly fee. Inspection — fixed per-visit price depending on city and car type. The price is always shown before you confirm. No hidden fees.\",\n          \"q\": \"How is the price formed?\"\n        },\n        \"payment_methods\": {\n          \"a\": \"Visa / Mastercard, Apple Pay, Google Pay, SEPA transfer (for EU). All payments go through Stripe, a secure acquirer. We don't accept cash.\",\n          \"q\": \"How can I pay?\"\n        },\n        \"title\": \"Pricing & payment\",\n        \"when_charged\": {\n          \"a\": \"Selection: upon subscription start. Inspection: funds are reserved on confirmation and released to the inspector only after the report is uploaded. Until then it's held in escrow on our side.\",\n          \"q\": \"When is my card charged?\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"safety\": {\n        \"data_privacy\": {\n          \"a\": \"We store only what's needed for selection and inspection: contacts, search criteria, reports. We never sell data to third parties. You can delete your account — data is wiped within 30 days (except records we must keep by law).\",\n          \"q\": \"What about my data?\"\n        },\n        \"dispute\": {\n          \"a\": \"You have 72 hours to raise a dispute. Open it in the request chat → an independent second inspector re-checks the contested points free of charge. If the discrepancy is confirmed — full refund.\",\n          \"q\": \"What if I disagree with the report?\"\n        },\n        \"guarantee\": {\n          \"a\": \"The truthfulness of the report: if within 30 days of purchase a hidden defect surfaces that the inspector should have caught, we refund the inspection fee and partially cover the repair per the contract terms.\",\n          \"q\": \"What do you guarantee?\"\n        },\n        \"refund\": {\n          \"a\": \"If the inspection didn't happen due to our fault — full refund within 3 business days to the same card. If due to your fault (you cancelled after the inspector was dispatched) — only the on-site call-out fee is retained, per city tariff.\",\n          \"q\": \"How do refunds work?\"\n        },\n        \"title\": \"Guarantees & safety\"\n      },\n      \"selection\": {\n        \"agreement_flow\": {\n          \"a\": \"Your specialist sends 1–3 cars per day to your request chat. Each one has photos, price, key numbers and their note. You say \\\"yes\\\" — we contact the seller, schedule a viewing, and dispatch an inspector.\",\n          \"q\": \"How do we agree on a candidate?\"\n        },\n        \"duration_selection\": {\n          \"a\": \"On average 3–10 days to find the first candidate that passes our filters. Rare specs or unusual models can take up to 4 weeks. You see progress live in the app.\",\n          \"q\": \"How long does selection take?\"\n        },\n        \"how_we_find\": {\n          \"a\": \"You set your criteria: make, model, budget, year, mileage, transmission, region. Our specialist monitors marketplaces 24/7 and sends you the top 3 candidates with a short note — what's good, what's a red flag. You decide which one to pursue.\",\n          \"q\": \"How does the selection work?\"\n        },\n        \"pre_visit_checks\": {\n          \"a\": \"VIN history (CarVertical / Carfax style), odometer cross-check with service records, seller type (private / flipper / dealer), price vs market, photo analysis for signs of hidden issues. If something looks critical — we skip the listing.\",\n          \"q\": \"What's verified before the inspector visits?\"\n        },\n        \"sources\": {\n          \"a\": \"Germany: mobile.de, autoscout24, kleinanzeigen, dealer feeds. Austria: autoscout24.at, willhaben.at. Plus private listings and closed dealer networks from our partners.\",\n          \"q\": \"Where do you search for cars?\"\n        },\n        \"title\": \"Car selection\"\n      },\n      \"support\": {\n        \"languages\": {\n          \"a\": \"English, German, Russian. The app interface and inspection reports are also available in all three languages.\",\n          \"q\": \"What languages does support speak?\"\n        },\n        \"response_time\": {\n          \"a\": \"Standard response time: under 6 hours during business hours (Mon–Sat 09:00–20:00 CET). Urgent issues on an active inspection are prioritised — under 1 hour.\",\n          \"q\": \"How fast do you reply?\"\n        },\n        \"title\": \"Support\",\n        \"where_chat\": {\n          \"a\": \"Profile → \\\"Help & FAQ\\\" → \\\"Contact support\\\". Or in any request — chat icon next to the status. Support replies in English, German and Russian.\",\n          \"q\": \"Where do I find support chat?\"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n  